{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00178",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.69,
      "end_seconds": 4.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "morning. Nice to finally see you, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.04,
      "end_seconds": 12.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "yes, come in, take a seat what can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 14.53,
      "end_seconds": 20.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "Doctor, um, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.65,
      "end_seconds": 25.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 27.21,
      "end_seconds": 33.7,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "I mean, doctor, it's been losing weight without trying. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.58,
      "end_seconds": 37.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Roughly when did it start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.54,
      "end_seconds": 43.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "I've had it it for six months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.23,
      "end_seconds": 49.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.02,
      "end_seconds": 66.08,
      "duration_seconds": 15.06,
      "text": "It usually comes with loss of appetite. I mean, the loss of appetite? That's been for ten days. Hmm, there was night sweats, yes, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.08,
      "end_seconds": 69.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.62,
      "end_seconds": 76.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.25,
      "text": "Yes, I had a lump removed from my back, years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.93,
      "end_seconds": 83.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.61,
      "end_seconds": 92.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "I mean, you know, I've never been told I have allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.53,
      "end_seconds": 100.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Which tablets or creams or inhalers do you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 100.85,
      "end_seconds": 104.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "He takes Glycomet, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.11,
      "end_seconds": 107.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 108.97,
      "end_seconds": 115.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "500 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box. It's hydrocortisone cream, when needed, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.67,
      "end_seconds": 121.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Right, any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.57,
      "end_seconds": 124.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "I have diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.3,
      "end_seconds": 126.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.13,
      "end_seconds": 129.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "I've had eczema, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.35,
      "end_seconds": 138.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "Okay, I can see diabetes in your file as well. What do you do to keep active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.31,
      "end_seconds": 143.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "I cycle to work most mornings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.87,
      "end_seconds": 145.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "How's your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.72,
      "end_seconds": 147.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "I'm mostly vegetarian"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.92,
      "end_seconds": 152.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Who do you live with?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.95,
      "end_seconds": 159.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "I live with my family, my husband and two kids"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.32,
      "end_seconds": 179.15,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Did you get lumps in the neck, shortness of breath or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.5,
      "end_seconds": 186.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.14,
      "end_seconds": 190.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "have you had diarrhoea, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.17,
      "end_seconds": 193.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "no diarrhoea, thankfully"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 197.16,
      "end_seconds": 202.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.47,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice diarrhoea. He doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.51,
      "end_seconds": 210.18,
      "duration_seconds": 6.67,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.45,
      "end_seconds": 220.26,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Did you get chest pain or blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.64,
      "end_seconds": 227.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.97,
      "end_seconds": 230.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.14,
      "end_seconds": 233.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "No changes there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 235.21,
      "end_seconds": 250.03,
      "duration_seconds": 14.82,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. BMI works out to 22.5, weight 52 kilos, temperature 38.1, pulse 99, height 152 centimetres, oxygen saturation is 96 percent, pressure 115 over 77."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.55,
      "end_seconds": 251.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "okay, noted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.83,
      "end_seconds": 256.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Okay, I need to examine you for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.09,
      "end_seconds": 261.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "right, stay still while I have a look"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.71,
      "end_seconds": 277.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "air entry is a bit reduced at the top of the right lung"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.71,
      "end_seconds": 282.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "So, just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.32,
      "end_seconds": 298.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "I can feel a couple of small glands in your neck, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.93,
      "end_seconds": 305.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "That's all I need, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.18,
      "end_seconds": 336.85,
      "duration_seconds": 12.67,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it points towards an infection or something chronic going on, I can't say what yet. A thyroid problem is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.2,
      "end_seconds": 358.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.36,
      "text": "Let's book a sputum test to look into chronic cough. A chest X-ray is what I'd like next, for weight loss and cough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 359.81,
      "end_seconds": 362.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Does it need any preparation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.45,
      "end_seconds": 386.7,
      "duration_seconds": 23.25,
      "text": "Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I'll also refer you to the chest clinic. Let's plan a check after the results are back. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.76,
      "end_seconds": 390.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Thanks, that was helpful."
    }
  ]
}